{"pin":"AB01329","subcodes":[{"code":"AB01329","anchor":"","first_line":"O pilgrim of the Sacred Dust!  Render a myriad thanks unto the All-Glorious, Who hath guided thee on this path… O loved ones of 'Abdu'l-Baha! Man's life has its springtime","first_line_orig":"ای زائر تربت مقدسه شکر جزیل رب جلیل را که دلیل این سبیل بود و ترا بدرگاه  ","language":"Per","word_count":"340","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AHB.122BE #01 p.036x","source":"AHB","locator":"122BE #01 p.036x"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_105BE #03 p.17x","source":"AKHA_105BE #03 p.17x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHB.238x","source":"AKHB","locator":"238x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/436.pdf#page=124"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ANDA#06 p.66x","source":"ANDA","locator":"06 p.66x","url":"https://www.afnanlibrary.org/d/andalib-issue-6"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ANDA#57 p.61x","source":"ANDA","locator":"57 p.61x","url":"https://www.afnanlibrary.org/d/andalib-issue-57"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DAK#0236","source":"BRL_DAK","locator":"0236","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/437100243"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK2#371 p.264","source":"MMK2","locator":"371 p.264","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/SWA2/swa2-266.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MSHR2.116x","source":"MSHR2","locator":"116x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/o/MASH2/mash2-118.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#309","source":"ADMS","locator":"309","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/translations/ab01329_excerpt_youth/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_ATE#055x","source":"BRL_ATE","locator":"055x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/553813452"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_CHILD#38x","source":"BRL_CHILD","locator":"38x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/148652318"}]},{"code":"AB01329MAN","anchor":"man","translations":[{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"}]}]}
